// Article 5. Amendment: two thirds of the owners; no vote for an owner under a lien.
#require "2-assessments.charter".
Fact amendment
Fact voted Identified by owner * amendment
Act vote Actor owner Related to amendment
  Holds when True
  Valid when Not(lien(owner))
  Creates voted()
Fact carried Identified by amendment
  Holds when Count(Foreach owner: owner When voted(owner, amendment)) * 3
               >= Count(Foreach owner: owner) * 2

Clause 5.1 Approved "785c7661d4a0ef02859adfb1b8a6bfb8bf50df96fd90a0901ac8b09b6ac2bfa0"
  Norm "These rules are amended only by the votes of two thirds of the owners." => vote
Clause 5.2 Approved "141fd2e6a7425a07e3ba2b872ea4d7b3a8e6f4792111d4b00e550d55c51ef5e8"
  Norm "An owner whose house is under a lien has no vote." => vote
.
